//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: rt_entry.pine with a fixed default quantity (a Live route refuses percent_of_equity,
// 5108) — the PL1 live settle-window probe: a realtime IoC entry re-emitted while flat.
strategy("live entry (strategy-pine PL1)", overlay = true, default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1)
plot(close)
if strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
